          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elica owacce ni, “Winy lok pa Rwot: Rwot owaco kuman ni, ‘Diki ka onyoo moko kwon mapwotte adita acel gibicato ki cekel acel, ki cayiri adita aryo gibicato pi cekel acel ki i dog gaŋ me Camaria.”” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ladit me askari ma kabaka jeŋo ciŋe i kome, ogamo dog dano pa Lubaŋa ni, “Ka ce Rwot kikome aye biyabo wan dirica ki i polo, ci meno bitimme?” Elica ogamo ni, “In ibineno ki waŋi, ento pe ibicamone.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare-nu onoŋo tye jo aŋwen ma ludobo ma gibedo i dog gaŋ; gubedo ka pennye kekengi ni, “Piŋo wabedo kany nio ka wato? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi wawac ni, ‘Wek wadonyu i gaŋ,’ kec bene tye i gaŋ, wabito ki kunnu; ka wabedo kany, wato woko bene. Doŋ wubin, wacitu kombeddi wa i gony pa jo Ciria. Ka pe gunekowa ci wabikwo, ka gunekowa ci wabito.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gucako a ma piny pud ribiribi, gucito wa i gony pa jo Ciria; ento ka guo i dog gony pa jo Ciria nen, dano mo pe kunnu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pien Rwot omiyo jo Ciria guwinyo dwan lwak gadigadi lweny, ki pa aguragura, ki dwan mony madwoŋ, omiyo gubedo ka lok kekengi ni, “Nen, kabaka me Icrael owilo mony pa kabaka pa jo Kit ki luker me Ejipt, gubino i komwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omiyo gutwarre woko ki ŋwec ma piny pud ribiribi gularo kwogi, ci guweko kemagi, ki aguraguragi, ki kanagi, i gony ki berre, guriŋo gularo kwogi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka ludobo meno guo i dog gony, gudonyo i kema mo, gucamo, gumato, ci gutiŋo ryal mogo ki jabu ki bonni-gu, gucito gukanogi woko; ka dok gudwogo cen, gudonyo i kema mukene bene, gutiŋo jami ma tye iye, gucito gukano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dok guloko kekengi ni, “Gin ma watimo-ni pe ber. Tin aye nino me lok maber; ka waliŋ nio ka piny odoko leŋ, ci can bipoto i komwa; doŋ wubin, wacitu wacitit bot jo ma i ot pa kabaka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci gucito gulwoŋo lugwok dog gaŋ, gutito botgi ni, “Wan wacito wa i gony pa jo Ciria, nen, dano mo pe onen nyo owinnye kunnu, gin mo pe, kono lwak aguragura ki lwak kana keken ma gitweyogi, ki kema bene tye ma giwekogi ki berre.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lugwok dogcel gudaŋŋe matek, ci gitito pire bot jo pa kabaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka ocako a malo i dyewor, owaco bot luticce ni, “Abitittiwu kit ma jo Ciria guyubbe kwede ‘ka lweny i komwa. Gin giŋeyo ni watye ki kec; omiyo guweko gony gucito woko ka kanne wa i bar kun gitamo ni, ‘Ka ce gukatti woko ki i gaŋ ci wabimakogi makwo ka wadonyo i gaŋ.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laticce mo acel owacci, “Koŋ giwcal jo mogo ki aguragura abic ki i kin mewa mudoŋ, pien jo ma gidoŋ kany gibito macalo lwak jo Icrael ducu ma doŋ guto gutum woko-ni; wek koŋ wacwalgi ci wanen kite.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gucako kwanyo jo aryo ma luriŋ ki aguragura, kabaka ocwalogi i kor mony pa jo Ciria kun wacci, “Wucit wunen.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gucito gulubo korgi wa i Jordan; nen guweko jami i korgi ki ginaruka-gu ki lwak jami ma jo Ciria gubolo pi laro komgi. Lukwena gudwogo gutito bot kabaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwak gumol woko, guyako gony pa jo Ciria, ci adita acel me moko kwon mapwotte gicato pi cekel acel, ki adita aryo me cayiri pi cekel acel, kit ma yam Rwot owaco-ni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare meno onoŋo kabaka oketo ladit me askari ma en jeŋo ciŋe i kome me bedo lagwok dog gaŋ; dano gunyono en ki tyengi i dog gaŋ, ci oto woko, kit ma dano pa Lubaŋa owaco i kare ma kabaka ocito bote-ni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pien ka dano pa Lubaŋa nene owaco bot kabaka ni, “Adita aryo me cayiri gibiwilo ki cekel acel, ki adita me moko kwon mapwotte pi cekel acel, di ki ka onyoo ki i dog gaŋ me Camaria,” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ladit me askari ogamo dog dano pa Lubaŋa ni, “Ka ce Rwot kikome aye biyabo wan dirica ki i polo, ci jami ma kit meno bitimme?” En ogamo ni, “In kikomi ibineno ki waŋi, ento pe ibicamone.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci otimme i kome kit meno, pien dano gunyone ki tyengi ki i dog gaŋ ci oto woko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
